[{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l020","ordinal":298753,"en":"Since he mounted the bay Tootoru"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l021","ordinal":298754,"en":"And rode out on raids,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l022","ordinal":298755,"en":"When yesterday’s battle raged fiercely,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l023","ordinal":298756,"en":"Akbermet, daughter of Kaiypkhan—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l024","ordinal":298757,"en":"While nations gathered and peoples were thrown into turmoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l025","ordinal":298758,"en":"And many heroes died in the clash—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l026","ordinal":298759,"en":"Was the wife I captured."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l027","ordinal":298760,"en":"I hung an amulet around her neck,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l028","ordinal":298761,"en":"And painted rouge upon her face;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l029","ordinal":298762,"en":"Never speaking words that might wound her heart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l030","ordinal":298763,"en":"I cherished her tenderly."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l031","ordinal":298764,"en":"Yet from her I saw no child"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l032","ordinal":298765,"en":"And never heard an infant cry “maa.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l033","ordinal":298766,"en":"Karakhan, khan of the Künjüt,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l034","ordinal":298767,"en":"Had a lissome, sun-bright beauty"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l035","ordinal":298768,"en":"Who came from that land."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l036","ordinal":298769,"en":"To win that sunlike beauty,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l037","ordinal":298770,"en":"That lovely woman of sweet and fitting speech,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l038","ordinal":298771,"en":"That woman with lustrous black eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l039","ordinal":298772,"en":"To take such a beauty as my wife"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0046:b003:l040","ordinal":298773,"en":"And satisfy my longing once,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l001","ordinal":298774,"en":"A bitter enemy appears"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l002","ordinal":298775,"en":"In Aichürök’s eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l003","ordinal":298776,"en":"Gathering his nobles and khans,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l004","ordinal":298777,"en":"Hero Kyyaz stood there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l005","ordinal":298778,"en":"Demanding, “Give me the child.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l006","ordinal":298779,"en":"Hero Kyyaz continued to ask:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l007","ordinal":298780,"en":"“My moonlike wife Chürök,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l008","ordinal":298781,"en":"The warm heart within my breast,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l009","ordinal":298782,"en":"This alone was my prayer"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l010","ordinal":298783,"en":"To Almighty God:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l011","ordinal":298784,"en":"Fairy-born, unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l012","ordinal":298785,"en":"You have fulfilled my deepest hope;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l013","ordinal":298786,"en":"My poor dear, you have found for me"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l014","ordinal":298787,"en":"The child who will brighten my brow."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l015","ordinal":298788,"en":"The spring flowing through the hills,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l016","ordinal":298789,"en":"The young hero who will remain after me—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l017","ordinal":298790,"en":"Bring my son so I may see him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l018","ordinal":298791,"en":"Open my mouth, and kiss him!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l019","ordinal":298792,"en":"I shall uncover his radiant brow"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l020","ordinal":298793,"en":"And press him to my breast."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l021","ordinal":298794,"en":"Calling this child my support,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l022","ordinal":298795,"en":"I shall banish all my sorrow."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l023","ordinal":298796,"en":"To a white-bearded elder,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l024","ordinal":298797,"en":"One who has lived to a great age,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l025","ordinal":298798,"en":"I shall offer entertainment and discourse"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l026","ordinal":298799,"en":"And have him name the child!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l027","ordinal":298800,"en":"Saying this, hero Kyyaz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l028","ordinal":298801,"en":"Raged in fury."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l029","ordinal":298802,"en":"God had struck Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l030","ordinal":298803,"en":"And still he demanded the child."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l031","ordinal":298804,"en":"Before Kyyaz, greatest of the nation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l032","ordinal":298805,"en":"There was no way to refuse"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l033","ordinal":298806,"en":"The newborn infant;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l034","ordinal":298807,"en":"Such is this wretched world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l035","ordinal":298808,"en":"The unfortunate fairy-born woman wondered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l036","ordinal":298809,"en":"“What will the infidel do to the child?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l037","ordinal":298810,"en":"How will he bring about his end?”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l038","ordinal":298811,"en":"If he presses the baby to his breast,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l039","ordinal":298812,"en":"May God strike the infidel;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b002:l040","ordinal":298813,"en":"He means to slaughter the tender young one—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l001","ordinal":298814,"en":"Amid all the great festivity."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l002","ordinal":298815,"en":"Hero Kyyaz, strutting like a cock,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l003","ordinal":298816,"en":"Clasped his hands behind his back."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l004","ordinal":298817,"en":"He would not leave the child alone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l005","ordinal":298818,"en":"Yet he was somewhat afraid"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l006","ordinal":298819,"en":"Of Aichürök’s wrath."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l007","ordinal":298820,"en":"Uttering no words and saying nothing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l008","ordinal":298821,"en":"Hero Kyyaz stood thinking:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l009","ordinal":298822,"en":"The child was his enemy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l010","ordinal":298823,"en":"Would take vengeance without fail,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l011","ordinal":298824,"en":"And wage war on a vast scale."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l012","ordinal":298825,"en":"If the orphan lived to grow,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l013","ordinal":298826,"en":"He would take revenge and destroy him;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l014","ordinal":298827,"en":"They would gird themselves for combat"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l015","ordinal":298828,"en":"And batter one another to pieces."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l016","ordinal":298829,"en":"Hero Kyyaz knew this;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l017","ordinal":298830,"en":"He knew the child would be his doom."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l018","ordinal":298831,"en":"Burning and blazing like an ember,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l019","ordinal":298832,"en":"He restrained himself only"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l020","ordinal":298833,"en":"For fear of frail Chürök."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l021","ordinal":298834,"en":"That day hero Kyyaz"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l022","ordinal":298835,"en":"Simply brooded in anguish,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l023","ordinal":298836,"en":"Then into Aichürök’s presence"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l024","ordinal":298837,"en":"Kyyaz came running."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l025","ordinal":298838,"en":"To the moonlike woman Chürök,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l026","ordinal":298839,"en":"Into her burden of deep torment,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l027","ordinal":298840,"en":"To the fairy-born unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l028","ordinal":298841,"en":"Kyyaz rushed in."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l029","ordinal":298842,"en":"Laughing with false words,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l030","ordinal":298843,"en":"The wretch spoke with his lips alone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l031","ordinal":298844,"en":"Fawning falsely upon the child,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l032","ordinal":298845,"en":"Intending to take the baby in his hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l033","ordinal":298846,"en":"To have him named,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l034","ordinal":298847,"en":"Then, while the child was still an infant,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l035","ordinal":298848,"en":"To gouge out both his eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l036","ordinal":298849,"en":"Or, if he found the chance, slaughter him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l037","ordinal":298850,"en":"And remove the child"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l038","ordinal":298851,"en":"Forever from this world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l039","ordinal":298852,"en":"His words concealed another purpose:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0047:b003:l040","ordinal":298853,"en":"Hero Kyyaz, son of Bagysh,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l001","ordinal":298854,"en":"For the hero who would uphold the nation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l002","ordinal":298855,"en":"For the many Kyrgyz people in Talas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l003","ordinal":298856,"en":"For the champion who would be their support."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l004","ordinal":298857,"en":"When mighty Kyyaz demanded him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l005","ordinal":298858,"en":"Aichürök burned and trembled;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l006","ordinal":298859,"en":"She could not say, “I will not give him.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l007","ordinal":298860,"en":"Before the renowned hero Kyyaz’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l008","ordinal":298861,"en":"Overwhelming authority, Chürök’s"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l009","ordinal":298862,"en":"Life nearly left her then;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l010","ordinal":298863,"en":"Her tiny soul shrieked,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l011","ordinal":298864,"en":"And every bone in her body seemed to shatter."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l012","ordinal":298865,"en":"What began in the morning lasted until evening."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l013","ordinal":298866,"en":"If only I could return and see"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l014","ordinal":298867,"en":"Reedy Keng-Kol and Talas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l015","ordinal":298868,"en":"And take the young hero who remains of his khan"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l016","ordinal":298869,"en":"As my solace and support;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l017","ordinal":298870,"en":"If only, in his old age, I could show Bakai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l018","ordinal":298871,"en":"And my mother in her declining years,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l019","ordinal":298872,"en":"This token left by the hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l020","ordinal":298873,"en":"Saying, “The young hero has come boldly home,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l021","ordinal":298874,"en":"If only I could let them see him once."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l022","ordinal":298875,"en":"If only I could take my long-held vengeance"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l023","ordinal":298876,"en":"Upon the black-hearted choro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l024","ordinal":298877,"en":"And make the child my support—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l025","ordinal":298878,"en":"How many dreadful thoughts she pondered."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l026","ordinal":298879,"en":"Kyyaz has ten thousand, while we are few;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l027","ordinal":298880,"en":"Will he cast him into a pit?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l028","ordinal":298881,"en":"Will he rob the newborn infant"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l029","ordinal":298882,"en":"Of his sight in this world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l030","ordinal":298883,"en":"And send him to his death?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l031","ordinal":298884,"en":"The courageous woman Aichürök thought,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l032","ordinal":298885,"en":"Rather than walk brightly, poor wretch,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l033","ordinal":298886,"en":"Only to stand weeping in anguish,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l034","ordinal":298887,"en":"I shall summon a hero’s courage."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l035","ordinal":298888,"en":"Displaying the bearing of a warrior,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l036","ordinal":298889,"en":"I shall save alive"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l037","ordinal":298890,"en":"My only refuge and excuse."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l038","ordinal":298891,"en":"Though cast into fire, I shall not become ash;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l039","ordinal":298892,"en":"Though plunged into misery, I shall not become a slave."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b002:l040","ordinal":298893,"en":"I shall make my words more forceful."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l001","ordinal":298894,"en":"He means to tear me from my darling"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l002","ordinal":298895,"en":"And blind my eyes with grief;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l003","ordinal":298896,"en":"May the doomed man be struck by God!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l004","ordinal":298897,"en":"By tearing me from my only one,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l005","ordinal":298898,"en":"He means to extinguish me like a fire."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l006","ordinal":298899,"en":"God’s sun in the heavens grew dark,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l007","ordinal":298900,"en":"And in poor Chürök’s mind"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l008","ordinal":298901,"en":"Sixty sorrows came at once."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l009","ordinal":298902,"en":"Her heart was pierced and torn apart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l010","ordinal":298903,"en":"And Kyyaz, demanding, “Give me the child,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l011","ordinal":298904,"en":"Appeared in the guise of a dragon."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l012","ordinal":298905,"en":"Seeing him, Chürök"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l013","ordinal":298906,"en":"Shed tears from her eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l014","ordinal":298907,"en":"The madman hero Kyyaz stood there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l015","ordinal":298908,"en":"Preparing to take the child;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l016","ordinal":298909,"en":"If you had seen hero Kyyaz,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l017","ordinal":298910,"en":"He raged like a blue lion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l018","ordinal":298911,"en":"Aichürök stood shrieking,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l019","ordinal":298912,"en":"Tormented and distraught,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l020","ordinal":298913,"en":"Yet betraying no suspicion to Kyyaz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l021","ordinal":298914,"en":"Her heart wandered and broke apart;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l022","ordinal":298915,"en":"Unable to collect herself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l023","ordinal":298916,"en":"She shed tears from her eyes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l024","ordinal":298917,"en":"She could not wipe away her tears"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l025","ordinal":298918,"en":"Or draw back the mucus from her nose."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l026","ordinal":298919,"en":"The dear bird called the kazgaldak"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l027","ordinal":298920,"en":"Flies over the plains without returning;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l028","ordinal":298921,"en":"How much Aichürök had endured,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l029","ordinal":298922,"en":"All for the child left by her khan."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0048:b003:l030","ordinal":298923,"en":"The dear bird called 